<title>INDIA: Indian 14-day t-bill cut-off unchanged.</title>
<headline>Indian 14-day t-bill cut-off unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Friday it maintained a cut-off price of 99.81 rupees at its weekly auction of 14-day treasury bills.</p>
<p>The RBI said it received three competitive bids for 13.27 billion rupees and accepted all of them.</p>
<p>There were no non-competitive bids, it said.</p>
<p>The weighted-average cut-off was 99.81 rupees, the RBI said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
